# Day 39 – Build PDF Splitter & Merger

## 📌 Overview
On Day 39 of the 60 Days of Claude Challenge, I built a premium browser-based PDF Splitter & Merger application using Claude AI. The project focused on document processing, modern UI/UX, and client-side PDF management.

## 🎯 Objectives
- Build a browser-based PDF utility.
- Implement PDF Split and Merge features.
- Preview processed PDFs before download.
- Create a clean and responsive interface.
- Improve prompt engineering for productivity applications.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- Claude AI
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## 📚 Key Learnings
- Building complete productivity applications using AI prompts.
- Processing PDF files directly in the browser.
- Creating premium UI/UX for utility tools.
- Enhancing prompt engineering skills.
- Improving frontend development workflow.

## 🚀 Outcome
Successfully developed a modern PDF Splitter & Merger with an intuitive interface, browser-based processing, and efficient document management features.

